      "value": "What constitutes a \"bad\" avatar anyways? Loud noises? Annoying shaders? You can block these you know. And if you're reporting unoptimized avatars that's what the hide avatar button is for. Why would the \"poor\" badge even exist if those avatars weren't allowed?",
