      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Moving the \"Report Avatar\" button to the Avatar Details page would likely solve this specific issue. But we might need some easy way to navigate players to the menu so they know where/how to report it.\n\nPS: More ways to open the avatar details page for a particular avatar might be useful in this case. Such as if the player that was wearing it just changed avatar, and you want to report the previous avatar they wore.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
