  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-02-01T04:51:47.202Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "A lot of people are really confused on how to properly report avatars and avatar authors. \n\nI was told to to report the person wearing the avatar, even if it's your friend. I was told that reporting an avatar, your friend is wearing, reports the avatar only, along with the author of that avatar. \n\nI was told this won't harm your friend wearing it and not to report the author of the avatar because then they will never find out which avatar is reported specifically.\n\nthe report menu should be made more clear that we are reporting the avatar only and not the person using it\n\nlots of times, we are world hopping and find an avatar that's bad in that world the only way to report this is by reporting my friend wearing it.",
